    "body": "## Summary\n- notify a reporter when a job report reaches `REVIEWED` or `DISMISSED`\n- persist distinct `JOB_REPORT_REVIEWED` / `JOB_REPORT_DISMISSED` notification types and link them to the reported job\n- keep notification content coarse: no moderator identity, internal moderation note, enforcement reason or sanction outcome\n- add service tests for both terminal moderation decisions and document the privacy boundary\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- notifications are visible only to the authenticated reporter through the existing notification inbox/realtime channel\n- moderation notes and enforcement audits remain admin-only\n- report resolution does not itself imply or disclose a listing/account sanction\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build and existing runtime/smoke checks. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
